flowchart TD
    G["73rd Amendment + State Act"] --> Z["ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಪಂಚಾಯತ್ (Zilla Panchayat — district)"]
    Z --> T["ತಾಲ್ಲೂಕು ಪಂಚಾಯತ್ (Taluk Panchayat — block)"]
    T --> V["ಗ್ರಾಮ ಪಂಚಾಯತ್ (Gram Panchayat — village)"]
    V --> S["ಗ್ರಾಮ ಸಭೆ (Gram Sabha — all voters)"]
    V --> A["VAO (Village Accountant — revenue records)"]
    V --> P["PDO (Panchayat Development Officer)"]
    A -.-> R["Reports to: Tahsildar / Revenue Dept"]
    P -.-> D["Reports to: Panchayat / RDPR Dept"]
